  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHq/1265",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/de5c9bb501ebe6ef056e68555af4ea000ac66d07?download\" data-file-name=\"화학반응식 활동지(공유용).hwp\" data-file-size=\"36864\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D1265%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20260318141439&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fde5c9bb501ebe6ef056e68555af4ea000ac66d07')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">화학반응식 활동지(공유용)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">36.00KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이번에 재과만에서 아이디어를 받아 너무 재밌게 수업을 해서 공유드립니다!</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://phet.colorado.edu/sims/html/balancing-chemical-equations/latest/balancing-chemical-equations_all.html?locale=ko\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://phet.colorado.edu/sims/html/balancing-chemical-equations/latest/balancing-chemical-equations_all.html?locale=ko</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"&#8234;Balancing Chemical Equations&#8236;\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"phet.colorado.edu\" data-og-source-url=\"https://phet.colorado.edu/sims/html/balancing-chemical-equations/latest/balancing-chemical-equations_all.html?locale=ko\" data-og-url=\"https://phet.colorado.edu/sims/html/balancing-chemical-equations/latest/balancing-chemical-equations_en.html\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/DINB8/dJMb9c9wOO8/HVOLnHQE4NC3SZLvfqf3GK/img.png?width=600&amp;height=394&amp;face=0_0_600_394\"><a href=\"https://phet.colorado.edu/sims/html/balancing-chemical-equations/latest/balancing-chemical-equations_all.html?locale=ko\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://phet.colorado.edu/sims/html/balancing-chemical-equations/latest/balancing-chemical-equations_all.html?locale=ko\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/DINB8/dJMb9c9wOO8/HVOLnHQE4NC3SZLvfqf3GK/img.png?width=600&amp;height=394&amp;face=0_0_600_394\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">&#8234;Balancing Chemical Equations&#8236;</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">phet.colorado.edu</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>화학반응식 만드는 방법을 설명한 다음 위의 링크로 들어가 메탄 연소로 활동지 작성 예시를 보여주고,</p><p>각자 활동지를 스스로 채운 후 게임까지 시켰습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>활동지에 있는 1번과 2번을 작성한 후 사이트에 들어가 화학반응식을 만들어 3번에 작성하도록 하면 됩니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/051c9cfc5d8060b3c0fbffcb5d1addee4027def8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/051c9cfc5d8060b3c0fbffcb5d1addee4027def8\" data-origin-width=\"886\" data-origin-height=\"220\"></div><p>사이트에 들어가 메탄 연소 과정을 클릭합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8daae028b184e1980ae9b9470823ab13202dec45\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8daae028b184e1980ae9b9470823ab13202dec45\" data-origin-width=\"920\" data-origin-height=\"407\"></div><p>이렇게 계수를 1로 설정한 다음 화살표 양쪽의 원자의 종류와 개수를 맞추면</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/94fa9e0d38182ec1749d66fb1b11fbe54b3ccb00\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/94fa9e0d38182ec1749d66fb1b11fbe54b3ccb00\" data-origin-width=\"887\" data-origin-height=\"548\"></div><p>이렇게 됩니다. 이렇게 맞춘 후 활동지 3번을 작성하면 됩니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아래에 게임도 있어 아이들이 정말 좋아합니다! 화학반응식 어려워하는 학생들도 잘 참여했습니다 :)</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
